@startuml SD09
' SD09 — /ask from the CLI (UC-05 via CLI, F04)
' Demonstrates that the CLI path converges on AgentController and is
' thereafter identical to SD03.

title SD09 — /ask from the CLI (UC-05 via CLI, F04)

actor Student
participant "CLI" as CLI
participant "CommandInvoker" as INV
participant "AgentController" as AC
participant "Planner" as PL
participant "ToolManager" as TM
participant "SearchTool" as ST
participant "LLMClient" as LLM
participant "ResponseParser" as RP

Student -> CLI: type "/ask how does BFS differ from DFS?" + Enter
CLI -> CLI: registerCommands() lookup "/ask"
CLI -> CLI: AskCommand.parse("how does BFS differ from DFS?")
CLI -> INV: execute(AskCommand)
INV -> AC: askQuestion("how does BFS differ from DFS?")

note over CLI, AC
  from here the path is
  identical to SD03
end note

AC -> PL: plan("qa", {q})
PL --> AC: Plan[step1=hybridSearch, step2=answer]
AC -> TM: execute("search", ctx)
TM -> ST: hybridSearch(q, topK=8)
ST --> AC: List<Chunk> (ranked)

alt top score below threshold
  AC --> INV: AnswerDTO(notFound=true)
else relevant
  AC -> LLM: stream(Prompt)
  LLM --> RP: parseAnswer(raw, chunks)
  RP --> AC: AnswerDTO(text, citations, followUps)
end

AC --> INV: Result
INV --> CLI: Result
CLI -> CLI: BiConsumer renderer: print text + citation list
CLI --> Student: answer printed to stdout, no GUI involved

note over Student, AC
  Same AgentController, same tools,
  same validation as the GUI path
end note

@enduml
